00:01:21.245 --> 00:01:23.000
- It's cardboard ground up deep-fried.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.540
- Mmm, I think it's real meat.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:26.760
- You cares if it's actually chicken.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.193
